      "text": "Be ye strong … for your work shall be rewarded, 2 Chr. 15:7. Give them according to their deeds, Ps. 28:4 (Rev. 2:23). renderest to every man according to his work, Ps. 62:12 (Prov. 24:12, 29; Rom. 2:5–11). God shall bring every work into judgment, Eccl. 12:14. to give every man according to his ways, Jer. 17:10 (32:19). do justly, and to love mercy, and to walk humbly, Micah 6:8.",
