      "text": "riches … seek them for the intent to do good, Jacob 2:19. when ye are in the service of your fellow beings ye are only in the service of your God, Mosiah 2:17. always abounding in good works, Mosiah 5:15 (Alma 7:24). if a man bringeth forth good works, Alma 5:41. called … on account of their exceeding faith and good works, Alma 13:3. bringeth forth good works, and prayeth continually, Alma 26:22. if ye do not any of these things, behold, your prayer is vain, Alma 34:28. this life is the day for men to perform their labors, Alma 34:32. see that ye do all things in worthiness, Morm. 9:29.",
